3
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:13,771
Meet Chorus. One shared space for the goal, the people, the budget,

4
00:00:13,771 --> 00:00:17,400
and the work. Finally, everyone is on the same page.

5
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,269
Let's launch a community art campaign. Give it a name, set a five

6
00:00:22,269 --> 00:00:26,158
hundred dollar target, and define what done looks like. The project

7
00:00:26,158 --> 00:00:28,445
becomes the team's shared source of truth.

8
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:37,116
Bring the right people in with a private invitation. Owners, administrators,

9
00:00:37,116 --> 00:00:41,780
and contributors have distinct permissions. Everyone can see the objective.

10
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,400
Everyone knows where they fit.

11
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:49,383
Break the campaign into manageable tasks. Move the artwork into progress,

12
00:00:49,383 --> 00:00:53,342
then record the outcome when it's complete. Optional near AI planning

13
00:00:53,342 --> 00:00:55,978
