14
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:02,350
Contributions have their own ledger. Here, Maya reports one hundred

15
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:06,437
and fifty dollars. Chorus keeps that separate from verified funds.

16
00:01:06,437 --> 00:01:09,281
A number in a dashboard should never pretend to be a payment.

17
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:16,906
Set a transaction cap, a total budget, and allowed categories. Purchase

18
00:01:16,906 --> 00:01:21,202
requests carry an exact purpose, provider, and amount. Human approvals

19
00:01:21,202 --> 00:01:24,876
remain subject to policy and verified funds. Your budget deserves

20
00:01:24,876 --> 00:01:25,400
boundaries.

21
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:30,566
For project funding, Chorus integrates near Intents: wrapped near

22
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:35,686
