23
00:01:35,686 --> 00:01:39,400
the contributor confirms the mainnet transaction in their own wallet.

24
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:44,808
Every recorded change joins the activity ledger. Filter by project

25
00:01:44,808 --> 00:01:49,210
or person, then export the record. Collaboration becomes easier when

26
00:01:49,210 --> 00:01:51,400
